                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f0002e47-492f-4aa8-a0df-e5037edbef14",
                                                "sense_id": "37388901-ac28-3343-ba99-62ce2371927a",
                                                "text": "In this solid account of the calamitous effect of dry utopianism on New York City, Lerner explains how the Prohibition amendment was passed and why its execution failed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "19540d0c-ff77-4b80-aa0b-ee1e6cb6ad32",
                                                "sense_id": "37388901-ac28-3343-ba99-62ce2371927a",
                                                "text": "Barack Obama in 2008 was probably the last western leader to capture this sentiment, with his slogan “Hope and change”. […] That shared utopianism allowed tech leaders to bond with political leaders."
